  "totalBlocks": 60,
  "translatedBlocks": 58,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c5aeaaca3135070",
      "translationZh": "Blackwell vLLM 配置方案：为什么 NVFP4 KV 很重要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0db21b95d145f64e",
      "translationZh": "我发布了两套适用于 Blackwell GPU 的 vLLM 配置方案：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6637d4656c7dd104",
      "translationZh": "两者都围绕同一个思路构建：Blackwell 能很好地处理原生 FP4，因此 KV 缓存也应该从中受益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47ff3886d03e3555",
      "translationZh": "大多数运行量化模型的人已经熟悉 FP4/NVFP4 模型权重。模型变得更小，就能留出更多显存用于上下文和并发。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afbdb38e79560e8b",
      "translationZh": "NVFP4 KV 将同样的思路应用于 KV 缓存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff6869efeb5de874",
      "translationZh": "这些构建版本不再以 BF16、FP16 或 FP8 存储 KV 缓存，而是以 NVIDIA 的 FP4 格式存储。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c989052a5d074fbe",
      "translationZh": "这很重要，因为随着上下文长度和序列数量的增加，KV 缓存会成为显存占用最大的部分之一。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "332d00e931a86978",
      "translationZh": "更小的 KV 缓存意味着有更多空间用于：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de5f80562cfcc2f5",
      "translationZh": "更多并发序列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ff9ab13d3ed8708",
      "translationZh": "更大的聚合 KV 缓存池",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f42a9456edb841f",
      "translationZh": "多智能体和多用户服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0592b50f014e1184",
      "translationZh": "在 5090 上，这可能意味着两种情况的差别：仅仅能够支持 262K 上下文，还是仍有足够的剩余容量，同时为多个有实际用途的流提供服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f9d24cdaa10de2b",
      "translationZh": "这些与原版 vLLM 有何不同？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0edb2809645d7f3a",
      "translationZh": "这些不只是启动参数不同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb552e551ee67f76",
      "translationZh": "它们整合了目前上游 vLLM 主分支尚未在常规受支持的 Blackwell 配置中同时提供的功能，包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "398214d73692e3dd",
      "translationZh": "MTP 或 DFlash2 推测解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0c270bdb9f7385f",
      "translationZh": "针对 Blackwell 的内核/后端开发工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "182f2a41c2a9a3c2",
      "translationZh": "长上下文并发服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24e974cb4f4ac776",
      "translationZh": "这些组合所需的工具调用及正确性修复",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d15355c5fa74571",
      "translationZh": "许多底层工作来自现有的社区 PR、FlashInfer/vLLM 开发以及其他开源研究。我整合了这些工作，在必要之处添加了修复，并将结果打包成可复现的构建版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "661c6111b805d2a6",
      "translationZh": "视觉塔在 CPU 边车进程中运行，而不占用 GPU 显存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b70c25147ba7e7c2",
      "translationZh": "对于这类服务器，我更愿意将稀缺的 GPU 显存用于：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b203f08671697e56",
      "translationZh": "权重 + KV 缓存 + 活跃序列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20eb3127b8cd25e3",
      "translationZh": "而不是将其预留给可能只是偶尔使用的视觉编码器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "867c5456344bef46",
      "translationZh": "你仍然可以获得多模态输入，同时为实际的推理服务工作负载保留更多 VRAM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11cc27e521153b3e",
      "translationZh": "这两个构建版本的侧重点略有不同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed67213229cd9fa1",
      "translationZh": "当前 5090 配置下约有 400K 的可用 KV 池",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e562300a0f4983f7",
      "translationZh": "强劲的解码性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ab978acc38c330a",
      "translationZh": "更适合多智能体、多用户和长上下文工作负载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15bf6df9e9175805",
      "translationZh": "你用部分峰值解码速度换取了更大的 KV 容量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "699f9e7b5a4c70a8",
      "translationZh": "在当前容量配置下最多支持 4 个流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94e1676540dba0bc",
      "translationZh": "速度显著更快的推测解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21a9b252e75a13a",
      "translationZh": "单流和低并发性能尤其出色",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c990ba42d89299c",
      "translationZh": "与 MTP 相比，你需要牺牲一部分 KV 容量来换取更高的速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b20214087aafada",
      "translationZh": "如果你拥有原生支持 FP4 的 Blackwell 硬件，并且注重最大限度地发挥单台服务器的能力，那么这些方案最为合适。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4409be03e8b0af9b",
      "translationZh": "这包括以下配置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c78324406174cca7",
      "translationZh": "2× 16 GB Blackwell 显卡",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d398243f565c417",
      "translationZh": "其他容量足够大的 SM120/SM121 系统",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61293fc7f6a5acf6",
      "translationZh": "它们特别适用于：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "709ad5062c6bad55",
      "translationZh": "并行运行的编程／研究智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34f7f3678370865e",
      "translationZh": "用单个 GPU 为多个持久会话提供服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e946b4eb3f9c29a2",
      "translationZh": "哪些人不应使用它们？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "709249796023299b",
      "translationZh": "如果你想选择最保守、受官方支持的路线，请使用常规的上游 vLLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ace787d3a07cf2ec",
      "translationZh": "这些构建版本有意在多个方面领先于上游。它们包含社区补丁和实验性组合，而这些内容尚未全部合并到 vLLM 主分支。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0706bacdaedea956",
      "translationZh": "官方上游支持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf512fd99f90b95d",
      "translationZh": "无法接受实验性补丁的生产环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e82cb2ac3cc11eef",
      "translationZh": "那么，原版 vLLM 可能是更好的选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfeb35ab5cf71677",
      "translationZh": "如果你现在就想进一步挖掘 Blackwell 的性能，这些构建版本正是为此准备的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81ad72d75324647f",
      "translationZh": "目标不只是获得一个巨大的上下文长度数值，或更快的基准测试成绩。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c438a76c84a68398",
      "translationZh": "而是让拥有 32 GB 显存的 Blackwell 表现得像一个能力强大得多的推理服务平台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e083628276333a3",
      "translationZh": "量化权重减少模型内存占用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "955c1549d43811f6",
      "translationZh": "NVFP4 KV 减少缓存内存占用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87e316a85bcdec18",
      "translationZh": "在 CPU 上进行视觉处理，避免将显存浪费在视觉塔上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ed1f153beac3f1a",
      "translationZh": "释放出的内存又可用于上下文和并发序列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20d527128a77c865",
      "translationZh": "这正是这些构建方案有意思的地方：让每块 GPU 完成更多有用的工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2559a9d5c724f94a",
      "translationZh": "这两套方案都经过了大量压力测试，而且已经有其他用户克隆并运行过它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "313e7458b9c87928",
      "translationZh": "欢迎提供反馈、PRs、错误报告和基准测试结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22fffcbf6bc904ac",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/SeanHighness 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "KV cache",
      "briefZh": "键值缓存",
